OL,3,GNEWSAMan in critical condition after
OL,4,Acity centre attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man is in critical condition after an
OL,7,Fassault in Leicester city centre.
OL,9,FOfficers went to Silver Street at 01:40
OL,10,FGMT following a call form paramedics
OL,11,Fwho were treating an injured man.
OL,13,FThe man, in his 30s, was taken to
OL,14,Fhospital where he remained in a
OL,15,Fcritical condition.
OL,17,FA 33-year-old man, from Leicestershire,
OL,18,Fhas been arrested on suspicion of
OL,19,Fgrievous bodily harm with intent and
OL,20,Fremains in police custody.
